<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 24-hour weather forecast - Oct 11.</title>
<headline>Philippine 24-hour weather forecast - Oct 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>++++</p>
<p>STORM ALERT: All Clear</p>
<p>				     ++++</p>
<p>METRO MANILA --  Partly cloudy to cloudy with rainshowers or</p>
<p>			thunderstorms. Winds light to moderate</p>
<p>			northerly to north westerly. Temperature -</p>
<p>			24 to 32 degrees celsius.</p>
<p> BAGUIO	 --  Partly cloudy to cloudy. Winds light to</p>
<p>			moderate. Temperature - 16 to 24 degrees C.</p>
<p> METRO CEBU   --  Cloudy with rainshowers and thunderstorms.</p>
<p>			Winds light. Temperature - 25 to 31 degrees C</p>
<p>METRO DAVAO  --  Cloudy with rainshowers and thunderstorms.</p>
<p>			Winds light. Temperature - 24 to 32 degrees C</p>
<p>The forecasts are by PAGASA (Philippine Atmospheric, Geophysical and Astronomical Services Administration)</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
